That's not like, that's not really a team name.

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.860
That's just like a vibe.

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:31.720
The Rockers and Hot Flash.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:35.940
Again, should have been like the Hot Flashes, but here we are.

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:39.860
The show lasted one season due to bankruptcy.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:42.660
Not that that's a surprise to anybody.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:47.510
But more importantly, as Sean said, this was sports entertainment.

