00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:07.060
Uh, nothing. Good.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:09.160
It's just sports entertainment.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:17.480
But, uh, I think that if I was introduced to sports entertainment in this fashion, I would have been super into it.

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.640
Like, this is my new favorite TV show.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:21.900
This isn't about the video game anymore, Mike.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.860
Right, yeah. This is just, this is actually now a roller games podcast.

