00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:46.000
Right. Like, oh, there's something about, oh, he'll be in the Hall of Fame, or he's a 19-year vet.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:47.020
Like, has this...

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:52.240
Like, there's no way that anyone has been playing this sport for 19 years as it is right now.

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:57.260
Like, they're making up, like, a world for you to buy into that they would hopefully...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.460
