00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.400
Yeah. Okay.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:21.560
So, and then, like, you know, most of the rules still kind of are in relation to roller derby in the sense of, like, how many people you pass are worth a certain amount of points.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:22.560
Oh, so that's real?

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:24.040
That's real. Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.720
Okay. Because I was like, how do you even score in this game?

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.420
