00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:31.140
Like, it's like...

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:34.700
Yeah, yeah, yeah. And, you know, I don't know the ins and outs of this particular...

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:40.320
Like, I think the exciting thing about roller games is it's kind of like...

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:46.480
And, you know, maybe you didn't have this experience, but, like, when I was a kid, no one ever, like, sat down and explained the rules to me.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:50.520
So, like, I would watch people watch basketball or football or whatever.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:57.940
And I would just have to, like, learn the rules after watching, like, game after game and be like, oh, that's what causes a first down.

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:59.980
You know, it's like nobody ever, like, explained to me.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.240
