00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:03.240
Like, all of a sudden, I'm just like, oh, it's a first down.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.680
Oh, because of the 10 yards.

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.420
Got it. Like, I'm five years old.

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:07.360
