00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.920
And all of a sudden, you become an expert.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:20.240
You're just like... I think, okay, aside from the lines that they have to get up to...

00:12:20.520 --> 00:12:24.120
To score, like, six points as opposed to two points on the wall of death.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.080
It is...

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.820
It is not...

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:31.700
