00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:43.880
Like, with something like basketball or hockey or football, it is displayed in a way that you can see most of the action where it's, like, needed to be seen.

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:45.420
And you can...

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:50.500
That kind of, like, allows you to form that context and see, like, oh, you're not going to be seen.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:56.100
