00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:14.120
Yeah, it needs that bird's eye view.

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.200
Yeah. Then maybe.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.760
But it doesn't do that.

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:24.780
Yeah. Well, the good news is that, like every other sport that I can think of, the team with the most points at the end wins.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.760
Yes. So that's good.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.120
